 "notes": "Raimundo 118 classical (nylon-string) guitar recorded in an anechoic chamber (very dry), mezzo-forte, mono centre mic. 15 notes E2-A#5 every minor third, each taken from the lowest-position string (open/low frets). The recording was tuned about 10-40 cents flat; every note was retuned to A440 equal temperament by resampling. Natural decay trimmed to 4 s. Add a little room reverb in the engine. Recommended release 0.25-0.35 s."
